          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lon",
            "lat",
            "lev"
          ],
          "description": "Fraction of the cmv profile's column released into layer gk (GEOS-Chem's 3-layer profile, Simpson et al. 2003 EMEP Table 4.1, renormalized): 0 above the profile or ktop, and the remainder of the column at ktop folded into it (upstream nei_layer_fraction). Broadcast over lon and lat, so a lane of the capacity build carries its own level."
        },
        "tz_offset_round_h": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lon"
          ],
          "description": "Time-zone offset in hours, round(lon_deg/15) with ties to even (Julia round): the EDGAR NOx hourly clock GEOS-Chem uses, applied by EarthSciML/EarthSciData.jl PR #226 (head jialinl6:Oct_merge @87f8da1) to the NOx and isoprene factors. CO and FORM keep tz_offset_h = floor(lon/15) (HEMCO)."
