          "description": "NEI2016 ISOP emission rate for SuperFast.ISOP, ppb/s. Chain: the regridded month-integrated flux density / days_in_month -> a true per-second flux; / (delp/g0) [kg/m^2] -> kg/kg/s; x 1e9*MW_air/MW_ISOP -> ppb/s, the factor uconv/MW_X of jialinl6/GasChemMTK.jl@37792b29 (branch superfast-gas-only) couple2(SuperFastCoupler, NEI2016MonthlyEmisCoupler), which EarthSciModels couplings/nei2016_superfast.esm also carries. Surface sectors (the merged file plus emln_othpt) go into layer 1 (the gk < 2 gate); the elevated groups (ptegu, ptnonipm, pt_oilgas: GEOS-Chem's 11-layer profiles; cmv_c3 + cmv_c1c2: 3 layers) are spread over the column by their profile fraction at layer gk, with the fractions above ktop folded into it (EarthSciModels nei2016_elevated.esm, EarthSciML/EarthSciData.jl PR #226 (head jialinl6:Oct_merge @87f8da1)). The upstream component's dimensionless Dz placeholder is dropped (it is 1.0 there, and a no-op).",
          "shape": [
            "lon",
            "lat",
            "lev"
          ]
        },
        "CH2O_emis": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "ppb/s",
          "description": "NEI2016 FORM emission rate for SuperFast.CH2O, ppb/s. Chain: the regridded month-integrated flux density / days_in_month -> a true per-second flux; / (delp/g0) [kg/m^2] -> kg/kg/s; x 1e9*MW_air/MW_FORM -> ppb/s, the factor uconv/MW_X of jialinl6/GasChemMTK.jl@37792b29 (branch superfast-gas-only) couple2(SuperFastCoupler, NEI2016MonthlyEmisCoupler), which EarthSciModels couplings/nei2016_superfast.esm also carries. Surface sectors (the merged file plus emln_othpt) go into layer 1 (the gk < 2 gate); the elevated groups (ptegu, ptnonipm, pt_oilgas: GEOS-Chem's 11-layer profiles; cmv_c3 + cmv_c1c2: 3 layers) are spread over the column by their profile fraction at layer gk, with the fractions above ktop folded into it (EarthSciModels nei2016_elevated.esm, EarthSciML/EarthSciData.jl PR #226 (head jialinl6:Oct_merge @87f8da1)). The upstream component's dimensionless Dz placeholder is dropped (it is 1.0 there, and a no-op).",
          "shape": [
