      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "Area-averaged class-7 fraction -> DryDepositionGas.f_water, as jialinl6/DepositionMTK.jl@cbe7d7db (branch superfast-gas-only) binds d.f_water ~ landuse_frac_at(gp.lon, gp.lat, 7) on the remapped grid."
    },
